ADDITIONAL TERMS — ACADEMIC USE

This project was developed as an academic exercise at Universidad UEES
(Universidad de Especialidades Espíritu Santo), Ecuador, as part of the
Machine Learning course (Semana 3, Grupo 4).

The dataset used ("Developer Burnout Prediction Dataset") is sourced from
Kaggle and is subject to its own license terms. Please refer to the original
dataset page for usage conditions:
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/asifxzaman/developer-burnout-prediction-dataset7000-samples

This software is intended for educational purposes. The models and results
presented here should not be used as the sole basis for organizational
decisions about individuals without proper validation on real-world data
and appropriate ethical review.
